1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:30,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:16,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 7]</font>

15
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I used to be the one tying you up.</font>

16
00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now the tables have turned.</font>

17
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:27,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How ironic.</font>

18
00:01:30,780 --> 00:01:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun, you must be settling
a personal score.</font>

19
00:01:34,980 --> 00:01:36,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was the one who spread</font>

20
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the news of the death here.</font>

21
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't hate me?</font>

22
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I certainly do.</font>

23
00:01:41,260 --> 00:01:42,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But on second thought,</font>

24
00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't bear to let you go.</font>

25
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:47,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you're so eager to see me suffer,</font>

26
00:01:48,420 --> 00:01:49,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll grant your wish.</font>

27
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:52,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I weather this storm,</font>

28
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you will still return to my side.</font>

29
00:01:56,900 --> 00:01:58,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's wait until you actually escape.</font>

30
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:20,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

31
00:02:20,940 --> 00:02:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any new findings?</font>

32
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:25,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We questioned everyone in the mansion.</font>

33
00:02:25,660 --> 00:02:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The deceased, before their deaths,</font>

34
00:02:26,460 --> 00:02:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were all maids
from the servants' quarters.</font>

35
00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They had all requested leave,</font>

36
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:30,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but their reasons differed.</font>

37
00:02:30,460 --> 00:02:31,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some claimed</font>

38
00:02:31,580 --> 00:02:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they were visiting family.</font>

39
00:02:32,860 --> 00:02:34,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Others said an elder was gravely ill.</font>

40
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:38,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But there is one strange commonality.</font>

41
00:02:39,740 --> 00:02:40,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every single one of them</font>

42
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had dressed up with great care.</font>

43
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then, they were never seen again.</font>

44
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed.</font>

45
00:02:47,140 --> 00:02:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Earlier, in the Prince's chambers,</font>

46
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the victim I discovered</font>

47
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wore a brightly colored silk dress.</font>

48
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:53,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you make of my theory?</font>

49
00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:55,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A woman with a gravely ill family member</font>

50
00:02:55,540 --> 00:02:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wouldn't dress so beautifully.</font>

51
00:02:57,460 --> 00:02:58,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her leave request was clearly a pretext.</font>

52
00:02:59,460 --> 00:03:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very likely,</font>

53
00:03:01,140 --> 00:03:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she was meeting someone important.</font>

54
00:03:04,020 --> 00:03:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Send more men</font>

55
00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to search every maid's quarters.</font>

56
00:03:06,940 --> 00:03:07,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There must be some evidence.</font>

57
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

58
00:03:11,620 --> 00:03:13,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this note was found
in the victim's room.</font>

59
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:18,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am smitten with you.</font>

60
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:20,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish to honor you in secret.</font>

61
00:03:20,660 --> 00:03:23,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tonight at the Zi hour, Jinxuan Chamber.</font>

62
00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, just look at this.</font>

63
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:26,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you say now?</font>

64
00:03:26,420 --> 00:03:27,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have witnesses and evidence.</font>

65
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can't talk his way out now.</font>

66
00:03:31,260 --> 00:03:32,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, listen to me.</font>

67
00:03:32,740 --> 00:03:33,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go back right now.</font>

68
00:03:33,780 --> 00:03:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch his every move closely.</font>

69
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:37,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But be careful.</font>

70
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:38,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If there's any danger,</font>

71
00:03:38,740 --> 00:03:39,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must leave at once.</font>

72
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:41,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But don't worry.</font>

73
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:43,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have 300 men helping you.</font>

74
00:04:07,900 --> 00:04:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

75
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

76
00:04:10,380 --> 00:04:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please look</font>

77
00:04:11,780 --> 00:04:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after the Prince tonight.</font>

78
00:04:13,500 --> 00:04:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would he need me to look after him?</font>

79
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:16,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You showed up so suddenly,</font>

80
00:04:16,780 --> 00:04:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">interrupted his treatment,</font>

81
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:20,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and triggered a relapse
of the Prince's poison.</font>

82
00:04:22,340 --> 00:04:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's extremely weak right now.</font>

83
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At any moment, he could...</font>

84
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:30,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm begging you.</font>

85
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:32,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the Prince falls ill tonight,</font>

86
00:04:34,940 --> 00:04:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must give him</font>

87
00:04:36,900 --> 00:04:37,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the pills inside.</font>

88
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I know</font>

89
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:41,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this medicine</font>

90
00:04:41,620 --> 00:04:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">isn't made from human blood?</font>

91
00:04:42,940 --> 00:04:44,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's Physician Liu's special formula.</font>

92
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swear this:</font>

93
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:47,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this remedy was made</font>

94
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:48,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">using humans' blood,</font>

95
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">may I die a terrible death.</font>

96
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't help.</font>

97
00:04:54,700 --> 00:04:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei.</font>

98
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:56,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you no heart?</font>

99
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:58,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you remember
that when you fell off that cliff,</font>

100
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince searched for you</font>

101
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:02,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for over a month on the cliff?</font>

102
00:05:02,780 --> 00:05:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know in your heart</font>

103
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how he'd treated you from the start.</font>

104
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You flatter me.</font>

105
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My name is Jun Qinglan.</font>

106
00:05:14,580 --> 00:05:16,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a Judicial Review coroner.</font>

107
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for how the Prince treats me,</font>

108
00:05:19,940 --> 00:05:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you saw how he forced</font>

109
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:23,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my mother away.</font>

110
00:05:23,580 --> 00:05:25,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you think the Prince did that?</font>

111
00:05:26,220 --> 00:05:27,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was because of Mrs. Jun</font>

112
00:05:27,540 --> 00:05:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he began to suspect your identity.</font>

113
00:05:29,860 --> 00:05:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her staying in Yanjing</font>

114
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:33,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would have been a hidden danger.</font>

115
00:05:33,660 --> 00:05:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If your true identity is exposed,</font>

116
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:36,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">neither of you will survive.</font>

117
00:05:37,220 --> 00:05:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you be so ungrateful?</font>

118
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:43,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if I am ungrateful,</font>

119
00:05:43,660 --> 00:05:44,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's not your place to lecture me.</font>

120
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:45,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You!</font>

121
00:05:45,540 --> 00:05:46,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

122
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take her away.</font>

123
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep her under tight guard.</font>

124
00:05:57,140 --> 00:05:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

125
00:05:58,140 --> 00:05:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did she do to you?</font>

126
00:05:59,420 --> 00:06:00,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you all right?</font>

127
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:01,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

128
00:06:01,860 --> 00:06:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just venting her anger.</font>

129
00:06:03,020 --> 00:06:04,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why take it out on you?</font>

130
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she has a problem, she can face me.</font>

131
00:06:38,740 --> 00:06:40,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know this can't hold me,</font>

132
00:06:41,020 --> 00:06:42,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you still dared to come close.</font>

133
00:06:43,620 --> 00:06:44,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you afraid</font>

134
00:06:44,580 --> 00:06:45,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I'd drain your blood?</font>

135
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

136
00:06:50,860 --> 00:06:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I became a bloodthirsty monster</font>

137
00:06:53,380 --> 00:06:54,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all because of your family.</font>

138
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:56,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Bloodlure Poison</font>

139
00:06:56,260 --> 00:06:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">makes me cough blood day and night.</font>

140
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:01,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can my blood possibly be enough?</font>

141
00:07:03,020 --> 00:07:04,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Naturally, I need the blood of others</font>

142
00:07:05,660 --> 00:07:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to replenish myself.</font>

143
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As I told you,</font>

144
00:07:09,260 --> 00:07:10,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my family</font>

145
00:07:10,540 --> 00:07:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would never do such a thing.</font>

146
00:07:16,780 --> 00:07:18,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you're proving</font>

147
00:07:18,900 --> 00:07:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your family's integrity?</font>

148
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Admit your true intentions.</font>

149
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:26,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know I didn't drink anyone's blood,</font>

150
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you still tied me up in this room.</font>

151
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't it to please Princess Changle?</font>

152
00:07:31,340 --> 00:07:32,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what if it is?</font>

153
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

154
00:07:34,340 --> 00:07:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">now you know how it feels</font>

155
00:07:35,460 --> 00:07:36,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be framed, don't you?</font>

156
00:07:37,820 --> 00:07:40,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're only confined here for one night,</font>

157
00:07:40,620 --> 00:07:42,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with His Majesty protecting you.</font>

158
00:07:42,940 --> 00:07:44,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But when my family faced false charges</font>

159
00:07:44,580 --> 00:07:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and were sentenced to execution,</font>

160
00:07:46,420 --> 00:07:48,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who gave us a chance
to defend ourselves?</font>

161
00:07:49,100 --> 00:07:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My family can be branded traitors
so easily,</font>

162
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:53,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet for you, it's suddenly unjust?</font>

163
00:07:54,820 --> 00:07:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The world cries out for your death.</font>

164
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can I not grant it?</font>

165
00:08:00,900 --> 00:08:01,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

166
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:03,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I betrayed His Majesty</font>

167
00:08:04,340 --> 00:08:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and my parents</font>

168
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to save your life.</font>

169
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:38,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

170
00:08:40,700 --> 00:08:41,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were the one who imprisoned me</font>

171
00:08:43,420 --> 00:08:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and also the one who fed me medicine.</font>

172
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are your actions so contradictory?</font>

173
00:08:51,740 --> 00:08:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have tormented me for so long.</font>

174
00:08:54,140 --> 00:08:55,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't think you can die so easily.</font>

175
00:08:56,820 --> 00:08:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know what those pills</font>

176
00:08:57,980 --> 00:08:59,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were made of?</font>

177
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:01,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Human blood.</font>

178
00:09:03,060 --> 00:09:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi lied to me.</font>

179
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:05,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She clearly said it was...</font>

180
00:09:05,580 --> 00:09:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my blood.</font>

181
00:09:08,420 --> 00:09:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your blood?</font>

182
00:09:10,460 --> 00:09:11,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To ease the Bloodlure Poison,</font>

183
00:09:11,660 --> 00:09:12,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the only way</font>

184
00:09:14,340 --> 00:09:16,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is to use my blood
as the medicinal guide,</font>

185
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:18,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">using blood to nourish blood.</font>

186
00:09:21,140 --> 00:09:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

187
00:09:24,820 --> 00:09:25,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you gave me the medicine</font>

188
00:09:26,420 --> 00:09:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because you care for me, right?</font>

189
00:09:28,020 --> 00:09:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Care for you?</font>

190
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

191
00:09:30,940 --> 00:09:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you deserve this.</font>

192
00:09:32,580 --> 00:09:34,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've suffered so much
from the Bloodlure Poison.</font>

193
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you ever thought
of reopening the case?</font>

194
00:09:37,060 --> 00:09:38,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hate you
because you didn't believe me.</font>

195
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You always claim it's for my own good,</font>

196
00:09:40,900 --> 00:09:42,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">making all the decisions alone.</font>

197
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:44,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That only brings me shame and pain.</font>

198
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

199
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:52,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

200
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:00,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

201
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you out here?</font>

202
00:10:02,660 --> 00:10:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's stuffy inside.</font>

203
00:10:03,460 --> 00:10:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just need some air.</font>

204
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:08,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed.</font>

205
00:10:09,660 --> 00:10:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty ordered him to do that.</font>

206
00:10:11,060 --> 00:10:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could he dare refuse?</font>

207
00:10:13,260 --> 00:10:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About the case from back then,</font>

208
00:10:13,900 --> 00:10:15,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what else is there that I don't know?</font>

209
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brother,</font>

210
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you know?</font>

211
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can I get you out?</font>

212
00:10:52,820 --> 00:10:53,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sanbai,</font>

213
00:10:53,860 --> 00:10:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">anything unusual last night?</font>

214
00:10:56,220 --> 00:10:57,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He coughed all night.</font>

215
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:58,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Other than that, nothing much.</font>

216
00:10:58,740 --> 00:10:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, can you release him now?</font>

217
00:11:04,780 --> 00:11:05,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

218
00:11:08,100 --> 00:11:08,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

219
00:11:08,780 --> 00:11:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you alright?</font>

220
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

221
00:11:21,820 --> 00:11:22,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have everyone here</font>

222
00:11:23,180 --> 00:11:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fully cooperate
with Ms. Jun's investigation.</font>

223
00:11:25,700 --> 00:11:26,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the Court of Judicial Review</font>

224
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:27,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is already biased against you.</font>

225
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:28,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if...</font>

226
00:11:28,780 --> 00:11:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't trust
the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

227
00:11:32,100 --> 00:11:33,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only trust Ms. Jun.</font>

228
00:11:33,740 --> 00:11:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,
what's that supposed to mean?</font>

229
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun.</font>

230
00:11:38,300 --> 00:11:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, my life and safety</font>

231
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are in your hands.</font>

232
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am not worthy</font>

233
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:45,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of such a burden.</font>

234
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:47,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

235
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as for the investigation,</font>

236
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can discuss it with the Prince.</font>

237
00:11:52,540 --> 00:11:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a bit tired.</font>

238
00:11:53,580 --> 00:11:54,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll find a place to rest for a while.</font>

239
00:12:17,340 --> 00:12:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brother.</font>

240
00:12:18,620 --> 00:12:19,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To save you,</font>

241
00:12:19,940 --> 00:12:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I let him be falsely accused.</font>

242
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was I being too selfish?</font>

243
00:12:27,420 --> 00:12:28,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you resting?</font>

244
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:29,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

245
00:12:30,380 --> 00:12:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why the long face?</font>

246
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just thinking</font>

247
00:12:33,620 --> 00:12:34,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about this case.</font>

248
00:12:34,980 --> 00:12:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't take Li Congyao's words to heart.</font>

249
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can he leave it all to you?</font>

250
00:12:38,660 --> 00:12:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He caused this trouble himself.</font>

251
00:12:40,020 --> 00:12:41,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who could possibly wrong him?</font>

252
00:12:41,460 --> 00:12:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

253
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I examined the bodies yesterday,</font>

254
00:12:44,180 --> 00:12:45,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did have some doubts.</font>

255
00:12:46,340 --> 00:12:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What doubts?</font>

256
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The wound is too deep.</font>

257
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:51,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Human teeth couldn't be that sharp.</font>

258
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Also, though the two desiccated corpses</font>

259
00:12:52,860 --> 00:12:54,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have wounds that were badly mangled,</font>

260
00:12:54,380 --> 00:12:55,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they were not identical.</font>

261
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you're saying</font>

262
00:12:57,220 --> 00:12:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan likely used something else</font>

263
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to drain the blood first</font>

264
00:13:00,940 --> 00:13:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then drank it.</font>

265
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm saying</font>

266
00:13:03,660 --> 00:13:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Prince Duan
may well have been framed.</font>

267
00:13:06,820 --> 00:13:08,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we all saw the note.</font>

268
00:13:08,500 --> 00:13:09,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I had it verified.</font>

269
00:13:09,820 --> 00:13:11,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The handwriting is his.</font>

270
00:13:11,540 --> 00:13:12,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Handwriting can be forged.</font>

271
00:13:13,220 --> 00:13:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a prince.</font>

272
00:13:14,660 --> 00:13:15,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When summoning a servant,</font>

273
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:17,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why would he bother leaving a note?</font>

274
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It feels more like someone</font>

275
00:13:19,460 --> 00:13:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">left it to deliberately mislead us.</font>

276
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway, he remains the prime suspect.</font>

277
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:24,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Precisely because of that,</font>

278
00:13:24,500 --> 00:13:25,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the doubts only multiply, don't they?</font>

279
00:13:27,820 --> 00:13:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, enough.</font>

280
00:13:28,900 --> 00:13:29,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

281
00:13:29,540 --> 00:13:30,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give you three days.</font>

282
00:13:30,980 --> 00:13:32,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get to the bottom of this for me.</font>

283
00:13:32,860 --> 00:13:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for the rest,</font>

284
00:13:33,900 --> 00:13:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll cover for you.</font>

285
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Chief.</font>

286
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:43,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan demanded that Mr. Jiang</font>

287
00:13:43,020 --> 00:13:44,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reopen the case.</font>

288
00:13:44,740 --> 00:13:46,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The deadline is three days.</font>

289
00:13:48,420 --> 00:13:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan, you've got some nerve.</font>

290
00:13:54,580 --> 00:13:55,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

291
00:13:58,740 --> 00:13:59,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

292
00:13:59,900 --> 00:14:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She harbors resentment toward you.</font>

293
00:14:02,180 --> 00:14:03,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she means you harm,</font>

294
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:05,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she can twist the truth into lies.</font>

295
00:14:08,700 --> 00:14:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

296
00:14:12,380 --> 00:14:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she wanted to harm me before,</font>

297
00:14:15,100 --> 00:14:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would I still be standing here
talking to you?</font>

298
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:18,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But after what she did to you...</font>

299
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silence.</font>

300
00:14:21,060 --> 00:14:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I overstepped.</font>

301
00:14:23,180 --> 00:14:23,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Jun Qinglan?</font>

302
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:26,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw her with Jiang Yufan earlier.</font>

303
00:14:26,940 --> 00:14:28,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's probably gone to Yizhuang by now.</font>

304
00:14:29,700 --> 00:14:30,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yizhuang?</font>

305
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:32,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who allowed her to go to Yizhuang?</font>

306
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

307
00:14:40,820 --> 00:14:41,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for me.</font>

308
00:14:46,180 --> 00:14:46,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

309
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:48,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are we strangers now?</font>

310
00:14:48,460 --> 00:14:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Men and women
should keep their distance.</font>

311
00:14:49,860 --> 00:14:51,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Always hanging on to each other</font>

312
00:14:51,020 --> 00:14:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a bit improper.</font>

313
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:54,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, you should be more mindful
from now on.</font>

314
00:14:54,500 --> 00:14:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You weren't like this before.</font>

315
00:14:56,100 --> 00:14:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why the sudden change?</font>

316
00:14:59,300 --> 00:14:59,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get it.</font>

317
00:15:01,140 --> 00:15:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

318
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly do you understand?</font>

319
00:15:04,180 --> 00:15:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't look good.</font>

320
00:15:05,660 --> 00:15:06,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should be more careful.</font>

321
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all, I now possess</font>

322
00:15:09,900 --> 00:15:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">extraordinary charm.</font>

323
00:15:12,460 --> 00:15:13,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

324
00:15:13,940 --> 00:15:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something important</font>

325
00:15:15,460 --> 00:15:16,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must make clear to you.</font>

326
00:15:17,780 --> 00:15:18,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Important?</font>

327
00:15:21,220 --> 00:15:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father is currently in Suzhou.</font>

328
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's discuss it when he returns.</font>

329
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:27,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear he may look down
on your humble household.</font>

330
00:15:27,060 --> 00:15:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I...</font>

331
00:15:27,420 --> 00:15:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

332
00:15:29,540 --> 00:15:30,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

333
00:15:30,780 --> 00:15:31,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">actually,</font>

334
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">those words I said last time
in Prince Duan's room</font>

335
00:15:33,140 --> 00:15:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about liking you</font>

336
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:36,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were all just an act.</font>

337
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:38,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I merely wanted an excuse</font>

338
00:15:38,780 --> 00:15:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to break free from Prince Duan.</font>

339
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:43,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was a move out of desperation.</font>

340
00:15:44,020 --> 00:15:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't misunderstand.</font>

341
00:15:45,300 --> 00:15:47,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't have feelings for you.</font>

342
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:48,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have no feelings for me?</font>

343
00:15:48,860 --> 00:15:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I truly see you as a brother.</font>

344
00:15:51,660 --> 00:15:52,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A sworn brother.</font>

345
00:15:54,780 --> 00:15:55,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan.</font>

346
00:15:56,420 --> 00:15:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

347
00:15:57,300 --> 00:15:58,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have terrible taste.</font>

348
00:15:59,300 --> 00:16:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should do
some serious soul-searching.</font>

349
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You haven't caught on at all.</font>

350
00:16:02,740 --> 00:16:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, slow down.</font>

351
00:16:04,060 --> 00:16:04,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slow down.</font>

352
00:16:05,500 --> 00:16:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

353
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't follow me.</font>

354
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:08,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you get so riled up?</font>

355
00:16:09,220 --> 00:16:09,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

356
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:10,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should we chase after her?</font>

357
00:16:12,260 --> 00:16:13,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let her go.</font>

358
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, don't follow me.</font>

359
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:27,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Following me</font>

360
00:16:27,180 --> 00:16:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has gotten you nowhere.</font>

361
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're really angry?</font>

362
00:16:30,420 --> 00:16:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can explain. It's not what you think.</font>

363
00:16:31,900 --> 00:16:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough. Stop talking.</font>

364
00:16:32,300 --> 00:16:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

365
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan,
I'll give you one last chance.</font>

366
00:16:35,180 --> 00:16:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

367
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think...</font>

368
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

369
00:16:41,870 --> 00:16:43,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

370
00:16:44,740 --> 00:16:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

371
00:16:46,410 --> 00:16:49,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

372
00:16:50,330 --> 00:16:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

373
00:16:55,010 --> 00:16:58,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

374
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:03,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

375
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:07,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

376
00:17:07,850 --> 00:17:13,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

377
00:17:15,990 --> 00:17:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

378
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:24,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

379
00:17:24,710 --> 00:17:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

380
00:17:29,250 --> 00:17:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

381
00:17:33,230 --> 00:17:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

382
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
